description:
Count words, characters (with and without spaces), sentences, paragraphs and lines in text, estimate reading and speaking time, list the most frequent words and check the text against common platform limits (X post weighted length, Bluesky, LinkedIn, SMS segments, meta description). Same rules as redbison.dev/word-counter.

Returns: JSON { words, characters, charactersNoSpaces, sentences, paragraphs, lines, uniqueWords, utf8Bytes, averageWordLength, averageSentenceLength, readingTime, readingSeconds, speakingTime, speakingSeconds, topWords[{word,count,percent}], platformLimits[{platform,limit,used,remaining,over,detail}] }.
Example input: {"text":"Short sentences help. Long ones, full of clauses that wander, do not.","readingWpm":238,"speakingWpm":150,"topWords":5}
